{"product_id":"pod-salt-marshmallow-man-iii","title":"POD SALT - Marshmallow Man III","description":"\u003cp\u003eA smooth and creamy blend of fluffy marshmallows and strawberries for an indulgent and fruity vape. Finished with a touch of sweet vanilla. If you like your dessert vapes, you’re going to love Marshmallow Man III.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThis Marshmallow Man III Nicotine Salt E-liquid is a Fusions collaboration by \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/pod-salts\" title=\"Pod Salt\"\u003ePod Salt\u003c\/a\u003e and Marina. An original and exclusive flavour for an all-day vaping experience. In the third instalment of Marina’s Marshmallow Man trilogy, Marshmallow Man III lives up to its name.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Pod Salt Fusions range is an exclusive E-liquid collaboration project. Pod Salt brings you the world’s biggest brands and blends their signature flavours with our award-winning Nicotine Salt. Designed to taste delicious. Designed to Hit the Spot.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780453943,"sku":"POD S - Marshmallow Man III 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780486711,"sku":"POD S - Marshmallow Man III 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-marsh-mallow-man-3.jpg?v=1749916780","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-marshmallow-man-iii","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




